  ],
  "corrections": [
   "2026-10-05, on review: the women's Keen Newport H2 at USD 78 was dropped, its price read two ways and below the men's USD 130 for the same sandal; every price read from a search engine's snippet or an aggregator is marked unconfirmed (18)."
  ]
